WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.796
LegatorOCR turns scanned pages into a searchable PDF. Here are three images with slightly tilted text.

00:00:11.295 --> 00:00:21.757
One command corrects the tilt, reads the text with OCR, and writes the PDF and a text file. The timing table shows where the time goes.

00:00:25.012 --> 00:00:33.536
The recognised text, page by page. The demo images are generated, so the result is clean; real scans are harder.

00:00:37.784 --> 00:00:45.395
The PDF has a text layer, so it can be searched and copied. The program runs locally, with no account.
